я" gr="PR,norm" sem="" sem2=""/>для</w> <w><ana lex="развлечение" gr="S,gen,inan,n,norm,sg" sem="der:v r:abstr der:s0" sem2="r:abstr"/>развлечения</w>.</se></p>
